            "title": "Computer Systems - Quiz 3 (Graded)",
            "body": "Computer Systems - Quiz 3 (Graded)\nCourse: Computer Systems (demo course)   Student: Alex (demo student)   Date: 2026-10-20   Total: 7/14\nPage 1 of 3\nDEMO DATA - fictional student and course, generated for the MentorIA demo.\nQ1.\nTopic: Caches & Locality\nQuestion: Which loop order over a row-major 2D array has better spatial locality?\nStudent answer: Row-major (inner loop over columns)\nResult: Correct\nScore: 2/2\nGrader comment: Good.\nQ2.\nTopic: Cache Coherence\nQuestion: Under MESI, a core holds line X in Shared. Another core issues BusRdX for X.\nWhat is the new state?\nStudent answer: Stays Shared\nResult: Incorrect\nScore: 0/2\nGrader comment: BusRdX invalidates other copies: S -> I.\n\nComputer Systems - Quiz 3 (Graded)\nCourse: Computer Systems (demo course)   Student: Alex (demo student)   Date: 2026-10-20   Total: 7/14\nPage 2 of 3\nDEMO DATA - fictional student and course, generated for the MentorIA demo.\nQ3.\nTopic: Cache Coherence\nQuestion: Why does a write to a line in Shared state require a bus transaction?\nStudent answer: It doesn't if the line is clean\nResult: Incorrect\nScore: 0/2\nGrader comment: Other sharers must be invalidated (BusUpgr/BusRdX).\nQ4.\nTopic: Virtual Memory\nQuestion: What does the TLB cache?\nStudent answer: Recent virtual-to-physical page translations\nResult: Correct\nScore: 2/2\n\nComputer Systems - Quiz 3 (Graded)\nCourse: Computer Systems (demo course)   Student: Alex (demo student)   Date: 2026-10-20   Total: 7/14\nPage 3 of 3\nDEMO DATA - fictional student and course,",
